WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.319 --> 00:00:09.660 align:start position:0%
 
an apex  [Music]  not so fast  [Music]  cover me  tom clancy's rainbow six extraction was  originally called rainbow six quarantine  when it was first announced in 2019 but  for somewhat obvious reasons they  decided to change the name  extraction is an upcoming squad based  tactical shooter due to be released soon  on the 20th of january  the inspiration for the spin-off came  from a limited time event in rainbow six  siege outbreak which introduced the  operation chimera expansion  the outbreak event featured objectives  where teams of three operators fought  off the chimera parasite that landed on  earth  people who came into contact with it  became infected with the organism and  over time would heavily mutate and  become extremely hostile  given the outbreak event there is a  little bit of story we can catch up on  plus run over a few of the important  details that we already know about the  game before it releases later this month  the origins of the chimera parasite are  unknown  but sometime during the soviet era it  was discovered by the russians who put  it on board a capsule and fired it out  into space  early february 2018 the capsule returned  to earth  it crashed near truth or consequences  new mexico  boyd brooks a local of tlc saw a  meteorite fall from the sky one night  and decided to investigate  discovering the capsule at the site he  decided to load it onto his truck and  take it back to a salvage yard where he  would attempt to sell it online  however unbeknownst to him at the time  this would lead to him becoming the  first individual to be infected with the  chimera parasite  and so three days after finding the  capsule brooks found himself making his  way to the sierra county hospital as by  this time he now had a number of red  spikes protruding from all over his body  by this stage the parasite had now  spread to a number of others and medical  personnel were frantically attempting to  treat the infected whose numbers were  quickly increasing and starting to  overwhelm the hospital  one of the doctors ellen mcintosh the  chief of radiation oncology at sierra  county hospital recognised brooks when  he entered the waiting room  but just before she could start helping  in his care his eyes suddenly turned red  over the following seven days macintosh  managed to get a blood sample from  brooks and it began working on a  potential cure for the parasite outbreak  however by now the majority of the  town's population had become infected  and it was also around this time that  those infected by the parasite were  given the name  roaches  up until now government officials have  been successful in preventing the  parasite from leaving the region  unfortunately things were about to take  a turn for the worst  back in the hospital macintosh suddenly  found herself surrounded by the infected  but now they were acting differently  aggressive  fortunately before she was attacked by  one of her infected patients she managed  to barricade herself into the hospital  lab  the police and national guard responded  but with everything they tried the  parasite would evolve and a number of  different types of roaches met them in  the field  some of them fired projectiles  while there were others they had a  hardened shell capable of withstanding  heavy gunfire and explosives  team rainbow was ordered to enter the  town to help prevent the government from  using a nuclear weapon to cleanse the  area  rainbow was able to perform a series of  surgical strikes on nests  these strikes were fast and brutal and  the parasite was unable to respond  they located and destroyed several key  nests  they also became aware of dr mcintosh  and her research and made it a part of  their objective to extract her to help  put an end to the outbreak  although it was considered too dangerous  they were running out of options  and time  rambo was successful in fighting through  the hospital and rescuing dr mcintosh  they then retrieved the capsule from  brook's yard while macintosh continued  working on the cure  several years after the initial outbreak  in new mexico the chimera parasite has  resurfaced and has now spread to various  areas across the united states  fortunately this time team rainbow are a  little more prepared  following the original outbreak a new  division was established  the rainbow exergenus analysis and  containment team  or react for short  for years they've had hundreds of  scientists studying the parasite and the  best way of containing it  however the parasite has also continued  to evolve  it is adapted to earth and now no longer  requires a host  these organisms are called archaeans and  they come in a number of different  variations  team rainbow needs to dive into each of  these new areas to gather more  information about the parasite and find  a way to stop it  rainbow six extraction will feature 18  of the operators in siege including  ta-chanka lion  dock  well i'm not going to read them all out  they're on screen  most of the operators will have the same  abilities they have in siege in fact the  operators were selected based on how  well their abilities would fit into this  new type of gameplay  the easiest way to describe extractions  gameplay is to think of a cross between  left for dead and rainbow six siege  the operators still feel the same but  instead you're shooting parasitic aliens  rather than other operators  similar to the zombies and left for dead  the aliens have a number of different  classes and abilities  currently there is co-op multiplayer and  single-player modes  players will be completing objectives  across three different  maps are split into four distinct  regions new york city san francisco  alaska and truth or consequences  the objectives that are received are  randomly assigned from a list of 13  different tasks  this basically means it'll be very  unlikely to come across the same mission  and location twice  at the end of each objective you can  choose to extract and end the match or  you can continue on to the second round  and then third for greater  rewards however with each round it will  get progressively harder and if your  team wipes you'll lose everything  what creates a more tactical feel to the  game over other shooters is that  supplies are limited health doesn't  regenerate and injuries and deaths will  carry over to each round  so working as a team is a must  rainbow six extraction will be launching  on all the usual platforms xbox  playstation and pc  the game will also have full cross play  cross save and cross progression over  all platforms  also anyone who purchases the game can  invite two friends to play for free for  up to two weeks  admittedly when i first saw the gameplay  when it was first announced i wasn't all  that interested  but the more i've been looking into it  the more potential i can see  i loved my time in siege though i  certainly haven't invested enough time  to be truly competitive at it so this  could be a nice spin-off even if it is a  bit weird to see alien slash zombie type  enemies in a tom clancy game  i certainly don't think this is for the  majority of the hardcore siege fans but  i think this will help bring more people  to the title like those who may have  been put off by this steep learning  curve or as some people put it a  learning brick wall  anyway thanks for watching and i'll  catch in the next one  cheers  [Applause]  [Music]

